<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BFE opens at record high.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BFE opens at record high.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Fomento &amp; Exterior opened at a record 2,560 escudo per share high after news that Banco Portugues de Investimento bid 2,615 escudos at the privatisation.</p>
<p>BPI stock will open at 1115 GMT. The stock is expected to fall after the higher than expected privatisation price for BFE.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
